              "text": "Baaz maqamaat par kuch log aisi aurat ko jo bachcha paida hone ki wajah se mar jaye us ko bura khayal karte hain aur kehte hain ke woh napaaki mein mari hai, lihaza bad-naseeb aur manhoos hai, yahan tak suna gaya hai ke kuch log kehte hain ke woh mar kar churail banegi. Yeh sab jahilana bakwaasein aur nar-ri khurafaat hain."
