              "type": "p",
              "text": "Aaj kal aisa kaafi ho raha hai ke pehle wahan kuch nahi tha ab baghair kisi murde ko dafan kiye qabr wa mazaar bana diya gaya aur poochho to kehte hain ke khwab mein bisharat hui hai, falan miyan ne khwab mein aa kar bataya hai ke yahan hum dafan hain, hamara mazaar banao."
