              "type": "quote",
              "text": "\"Farzi mazaar banana aur us ke sath asal ka sa muamala karna na-jaaiz wa bid'at hai aur khwab ki baat khilaf-e-shar' umoor mein masmoo' nahi ho sakti.\" *(Fatawa Razawiyya, Jild 4, Safha 115)*"
