              "text": "\"Soorat-e-mazkoora mein nabsh haram, haram, sakht haram aur mayyat ki ashad tauheen wa hatk-e-sitr Rabb-ul-Aalameen hai, jo beta baap ke sath aisa chahe woh aaq wa na-khalaf hai.\" *(Fatawa Razawiyya Jadid 9/205)*"
