              "text": "Yeh ek ghalat riwaaj hai yahan tak ke baaz jagah mayke wale agar nadaar muflis hon tab bhi aurat ka kafan un ko dena zaroori khayal kiya jaata hai aur un se zabardasti liya jaata hai, aur unhein khwah-makhwah sataya jaata hai haalan-ke Islam mein aisa kuch nahi."
