              "text": "Baaz jagah mayyat ko ghusl dene ke baad tajheez wa takfeen ke waqt us ke balon mein kanghi karne lagte hain yeh mamnoo' hai. Hadees mein hai ke Hazrat Sayyidatuna Aisha Siddiqa رَضِيَ اللهُ عَنْهَا se mayyat ke sar mein kanghi karne se muta'alliq sawaal kiya gaya to aap ne mana farmaya aur farmaya ke kyon apni mayyat ko takleef pahunchate ho. *(Fatawa Razawiyya, Jild 4, Safha 33, bi-hawala Kitab al-Aathaar lil-Imam Muhammad, Safha 46)*"
