              "text": "Kuch jaghon par Rajab ki 21 tareekh ko roza rakhte hain aur use root-boot ka roza kehte hain. Khaas taur se is din roza rakhne ka Shariat-e-Islamia mein koi hukum nahi. Nafl roza saal mein mamnoo' dinon ko chhod kar kabhi bhi rakha ja sakta hai. 21 Rajab ko roze ke liye makhsoos kar ke use root-boot ka roza kehna, makhsoos wazan ki chhoti badi do rotiyan aur botiyan pakana, chhoti fatiha padhne wale aur badi rozedar ko khilana be-asl aur gadhhi hui baatein hain."
