              "type": "p",
              "text": "Baaz jagah nikah mein mehar Shar'-e-Payambari muqarrar kiya jaata hai aur us se un ki murad chaunsath (64) rupiye aur das (10) aane hoti hai ya koi aur raqam. Haalan-ke yeh sab be-asl baatein hain, Shariat-e-Payambar-e-Azam ﷺ mein mehar mein zyadati ki koi hadd muqarrar nahi hai jitne par dono fareeq muttafiq ho jayein wohi mehar Shar'-e-Payambari hai."
