              "text": "Kuch log samajhte hain ke shohar agar biwi ko talaq de to alfaaz-e-talaq ka aurat ke liye sunna aur aurat ka ba-waqt-e-talaq saamne hona zaroori hai yeh ghalat fehmi hai aurat agar na sune aur wahan maujood bhi na ho tab bhi shohar ke talaq dene se talaq ho jaye gi khwah shohar aur biwi mein hazaron meel ka faasla ho. Aala Hazrat Imam Ahl-e-Sunnat Sayyidi Shah Ahmad Raza Khan Sahab irshad farmate hain:"
