              "text": "Haalat-e-hamal mein talaq waqe' ho jaati hai yeh jo kuch log samajhte hain ke aurat hamal se ho aur us haalat mein shohar talaq de to talaq waqe' nahi hoti yeh un ki ghalat fehmi hai. Sayyidi Aala Hazrat Imam Ahl-e-Sunnat irshad farmate hain:"
