              "type": "p",
              "text": "**Tarjuma:** *Zina se haamila aurat ka nikah sahih hai agarche (ghair-zaani ke liye) sohbat karna haram ho, aur agar us zaani hi ne us se nikah kiya to bil-ittifaq us ke liye sohbat halaal hai.*"
