              "type": "p",
              "text": "Aaj kal agar koi aurat mutallaqa ho jaye to mayke wale us ko fauran apne ghar le aate hain balke is par fakhr kiya jaata hai, aur agar woh shohar ke ghar mein rahe to kuch log us ke maa-baap aur bhaiyon ko a'ar dilaate hain ke talaq ke baad bhi ladki ko shohar ke ghar chhod diya hai, yeh sab ghalat baatein hain."
