              "text": "Kaafi log yeh khayal karte hain ke mutallaqa ki iddat 3 maheene mein poori ho jaati hai yeh ghalat hai. Talaq-shuda aurat ki iddat yeh hai ke agar woh haamila na ho to baad-e-talaq us ko teen (3) baar maahwari ho jaye, khwah yeh teen (3) maahwariyan teen maheene se kam mein ho jayein ya us se zyada mein khwah saal guzar jaye agar teen baar us ko maahwari nahi hui to iddat poori nahi hogi."
