              "type": "p",
              "text": "Is bayaan se hamara matlab yeh nahi hai ke Khuda-e-Ta'ala halal kamai se de to achha khana aur pehanna najaiz hai, balke hamara maqsad ghayr-zaroori aur faltu akhrajat se baaz rakhna hai ta-ke kahin aap kamane ki zyada fikr mein be-imaan, kha'in aur haram-khor na ban jayein, aur deendari ki zindagi guzarne ke liye akhrajat par qaaboo rakhna aur fazool-kharchiyon se bachna zaroori hai. Aur is baare mein jaiz wa najaiz ki hudood jaanne ke liye fiqh wa tasawwuf ki kitabon ka mutala'a karna chahiye, khaas kar Sadr-ush-Shariah Hazrat Maulana Amjad Ali Sahab رَحْمَةُ اللهِ عَلَيْهِ ki *Bahar-e-Shariat* ka solahwan (16th) hissa padh lena ek Musalman ke liye fee-zamana nihayat zaroori hai."
