              "text": "Kuchh log jo shakhsiyyat-parasti mein hadd se aage badhe hue hain woh apni mehboob wa pasandida shakhsiyyaton ko doosron se manwane ke liye ladayi jhagda karte hain, aur jo mohabbat unhein hai woh agar doosra na kare to bura maante aur use gumrah wa bad-deen tak khayal kar baithte hain aur zabardasti us se manwana chahte hain, halaan-ke mohabbat kabhi bhi zabardasti nahi paida ki ja sakti aur na sirf fatwe laga kar aur na un mehboob bandon aur buzurgon ke naam ke na'are laga kar aur na joshili aur jazbati taqreerein kar ke."
