              "text": "Balke tareeqa yeh hai ke jo waaqi'i buzurg, sahib-e-kirdar Allah wale log hain yaani haqeeqat mein woh Islami nuqta-e-nazar se azeem shakhsiyyat ke maalik hain to un ka woh kirdar aur tareeqa-e-zindagi, karname aur deeni khidmat, Khuda-tarsi aur nafs-kushi sanjeeda andaaz mein samjhane ke taur par taqreer ya tehreer ke zariye logon ke saamne laiye aur jin baaton ki bunyaad par aap ko us sahib-e-ilm-o-fazal se mohabbat hai woh baatein doosron ko bataiye, agar woh bhi un ka aashiq wa dewana ho jaye to theek aur na ho to koshish aap ka kaam hai, ab aap zabardasti manwane ki koshish na kijiye."
