              "text": "Haan jo log aam taur se buzurgon ki shaan mein gustakhi karte hain ya aise aalim wa buzurg ke jin ki buzurgi wa bartari par poori Ummat-e-Muslimah ittefaq kar chuki ho un ki shaan mein bakwas karne wale hain woh yaqeenan gumrah wa bad-deen hain, woh agar samjhane se na samjhein to un se doori aur bezari zaroori hai. Aur jo gustakhi aur be-adabi na karta ho lekin aap ki tarah aqeedat wa mohabbat bhi na rakhta ho to us ke ma'amle mein khamoshi behtar hai aur agar us ke khayalaat behtar hain, Islami hain to us ko Musalman hi khayal kiya jaye aur apna Islami bhai samjha jaye."
