              "type": "p",
              "text": "Islami shakhsiyyaton aur apne buzurgon, peeron ya masha'ikh ko doosron se manwane ke liye sab se zyada umdah tareeqa aur behtar dhang aap ka kirdar hai. Aaj aise log bahut hain jo halal wa haram mein tameez nahi rakhte, namazein chhodte, gaane bajane aur tamashon mein lage rehte hain, un ki nityein kharab ho chuki hain, un mein Islami akhlaq naam ki koi cheez nahi hai aur phir yeh buzurgon ke naam ke thekedar bante hain, Urs karate, mazar banwate aur un ke naam ki lambi lambi niyazein dilwate hain, un ke naam par jalse juloos aur mehfilon ka in'iqaad karte hain, to yeh log qawm ko buzurgon se qareeb karne ke bajaye door kar rahe hain aur un ke yeh dhang logon ke dilon mein Allah walon ki mohabbat kabhi bhi paida na kar sakeinge."
