              "type": "p",
              "text": "Aulaad dunya mein Allah Ta'ala ki bahut badi na'mat hai, lihaza jis ko Allah Ta'ala yeh na'mat ata farmaye us ko chahiye ke woh Khuda-e-Ta'ala ka shukr ada kare aur agar na de to sabr kare. Magar aaj kal kuchh mard aur auratein aulaad na hone ki wajah se pareshan rehte hain aur is kami ko zyada mehsoos karte hain, halaan-ke yeh ahl-e-imaan ki shaan nahi. Momin ko dunya aur is ki na'maton ke haasil na hone ki zyada fikr nahi karna chahiye, zyada fikr wa gham aakhirat ka hona chahiye. Agar aap ne apni aakhirat sudhar li to dunya ki kisi na'mat ke na paane ka zyada gham nahi karna chahiye. Aulaad Allah ki na'mat zaroor hai lekin samajhwalo ke liye yeh baat bhi qabil-e-ghaur hai ke maal aur aulaad ko Allah Jalla Shanuhu ne apne Quran mein dunya ki raunaq farmaya, aakhirat ki nahi. Farmaya hai: **اَلْمَالُ وَالْبَنُوْنَ زِيْنَةُ الْحَيَاةِ الدُّنْيَا وَالْبَاقِيَاتُ الصَّالِحَاتُ خَيْرٌ عِندَ رَبِّكَ ثَوَابًا وَّخَيْرٌ أَمَلًا.**"
