              "text": "Islami nuqta-e-nazar se mard ko chandi ki sirf ek angoothi ek nag ki pehanna jaiz hai jis ka wazan sadhe chaar (4.5) mashe se kam ho. Is ke ilawa mard ke liye koi zewar halal nahi. Ek se zyada angoothi ya koi zewar kisi bhi dhaat ka ho sab gunah wa najaiz hai."
