              "text": "Kuchh log poochhte hain ke mayyat ko qabr mein rakhne ke baad agar mard ho to takhte kidhar se shuroo' karna chahiye sarhane ya payenti se aur aurat ke liye kidhar se, masla yeh hai ke mard ho ya aurat takhte sarhane se lagana shuroo' karein aur dono mein farq samajhna ghalati hai. *(Fatawa Mustafawiyya, Safha 71, Matboo'a Raza Academy Mumbai)*"
