              "text": "Aala Hazrat farmate hain:\n> \"Gurday khana jaiz hai lekin Huzoor-e-Aqdas ﷺ ne pasand na farmaya is wajah se ke peshab us mein ho kar masane mein jata hai.\" *(Al-Malfuz 1/34, Razvi Kitab Ghar, Delhi)*"
