              "type": "p",
              "text": "Kahin kahin kuchh log Holi ke mauqe par Holi naam ki aurat ki fatiha dilate hain, kuchh logon ne Holi ka naam Murad Bibi rakh liya hai aur is naam se fatiha dilate hain aur kehte hain ke Holi ka Hazrat Ibrahim Alayhis Salam par aashiq ho gayi thi aur un par imaan layi thi, to yeh sab ghadhi hui hikayaat aur jhooti kahaniyan hain jin ka haqeeqat se kisi qism ka koi ta'alluq nahi aur hargiz Holi ko koi haisiyat dete hue us se muta'alliq kisi qism ki koi fatiha nahi karna chahiye. *(Fatawa Bahr-ul-Uloom, 1/162)*"
