              "text": "Kuchh hazraat is sunnat ki ada'igi ke liye khane se pehle aur baad mein namak chaatna zaroori khayal karte hain halaan-ke is sunnat ki ada'igi ke liye namak chaatna zaroori nahi balke namkeen khana pehle aur baad mein kha liya jaye tab bhi yeh sunnat ada ho jaye gi kyonke namkeen khane mein bhi namak zaroor hota hai aur namak jise Arabi mein \"Milh\" (مِلْح) kehte hain us ke maani namkeen aur khaari cheez ke bhi aate hain, Quran Kareem mein samandar ke paani ke liye farmaya gaya: **هٰذَا مِلْحٌ أُجَاجٌ**"
