              "type": "scripture",
              "text": "**Hadees:** Hazrat Amrah bint Abdur Rahman wa Hazrat Maula Ali رَضِيَ اللهُ عَنْهُ se riwayat hai ke Sarkar-e-Madinah ﷺ ne irshad farmaya:"
