              "text": "**Mas'ala:** Nikah haraam hone ke liye dhaai (2½) baras ka zamana hai. Koi aurat kisi bachhe ko dhaai baras ke andar agar doodh pilaye gi to hurmat (yani nikah haraam hona) saabit ho jaye gi. Aur agar dhaai baras ki umr ke baad piya to hurmat saabit nahi hogi (yani nikah haraam nahi hoga). *(Bahar-e-Shariat, Jild 1, Hissa 7, Safha 19; Qanoon-e-Shariat, Jild 2, Safha 50)*"
