              "text": "**Mas'ala:** Musalman mard ka majoosi (aag ki pooja karne wali), but-parast, sooraj ko poojne wali, sitaron ko poojne wali in tamaam mein se kisi bhi aurat se nikah nahi hoga. *(Bahar-e-Shariat, Jild 1, Hissa 7)*"
