              "type": "p",
              "text": "Yaad rakhiye! Kafir-o-mushrik aurat se Musalman kar ke nikah karna jaiz to hai lekin ye koi farz ya wajib nahi balke ba'z riwayaat ke mutabiq Huzoor-e-Akram ﷺ ne ise pasand bhi nahi farmaya. Is ki bahut si wujoohaat Ulama-e-Kiraam ne bayaan farmai hain, jin mein se chand ye hain:\n1. Jis nau-Muslim aurat se aap ne shaadi ki agarche wo Musalman ho gayi lekin us ke saare mayke wale kafir hain aur ab chunonke wo aap ke rishtedaar ban chuke hain is liye aap ki aurat aur khud aap ko un se ta'alluqaat rakhne padte hain aur phir aage chal kar mukhtalif buraiyan janam leti hain aur naye naye ikhtilafaat paida hote hain.\n2. Aurat ke nau-Muslim hone ki wajah se aulaad ki tarbiyat khalis Islami dhang se nahi ho paati hai.\n3. Agar Musalman mard kafir ladkiyon se nikah kareinge to kunwari Muslim ladkiyon ki ta'daad mein izafa hoga, Muslim ladkon ki qillat hone lagegi aur Muslim ladkiyon ko badi umr tak kunwari rehna padega aur zyada umr tak kunwari zindagi nayi nayi buraiyon ke janam ka sabab banegi.\n4. Deen-e-Islam mein mushrikana rusoom ka riwaaj padega."
