              "type": "p",
              "text": "1. Bil-farz Rasoolullah ﷺ ke baad bhi koi nabi aa jaye to bhi Huzoor ki khatamiyat mein koi farq na aayega. *(Tahzeer-un-Naas, Safha 14, Matboo'a Maktaba Faiz, Jame' Masjid, Deoband, U.P.)*"
