              "type": "p",
              "text": "1. Rasoolullah ﷺ ko jo ilm-e-ghaib hai us mein Huzoor hi ki kya takhsees, aisa ilm-e-ghaib to har kisi ko bachhon, paaglon balke tamaam jaanwaron tak ko bhi haasil hai. *(Hifz-ul-Imaan, Safha 8, Matboo'a Daar-ul-Kutub, Deoband, U.P.)*"
