              "type": "p",
              "text": "Yahi wajah hai ke hamare Hindustan mein zyadatar log meher nahi dete. Yahan tak ke inteqal ke baad un ke janaaze par un ki biwi aa kar meher maaf karti hai. Waise aurat ke maaf kar dene se meher maaf to ho jaata hai lekin meher ada kiye baghair duniya se chale jaana munasib nahi. Khuda-na-khwasta pehle aurat ka inteqal ho gaya aur agar wo meher maaf na kar saki ya meher maaf karne ki use mohlat hi na mili to 'huqooq-ul-ibaad' mein giraftaar aur deen-o-duniya mein roosiyah-o-sharmsaar hoga aur qiyamat mein sakht pakad aur sakht azaab hoga. Lihaza is khatre se bachne ke liye meher ada kar dena hi chahiye. Is mein sawaab bhi hai aur ye hamare pyaare Aqa Rasoolullah ﷺ ki sunnat bhi hai."
