              "text": "Huzoor Sayyiduna Imam Muhammad Ghazali رَضِيَ اللهُ عَنْهُ farmate hain:\n*\"Bahut zyada meher baandhna makrooh hai lekin haisiyat se kam bhi na ho.\"* *(Keemiya-e-Sa'adat, Safha 260)*"
