              "text": "Kuchh log kam se kam meher baandhte hain aur daleel ye dete hain ke rupaye, paison se kya hota hai, dil milna chahiye. Ye bhi galat hai. Meher ki ehmiyat ko ghatane ke liye agar koi kam meher baandhe to ye bhi theek nahi. Auraton ko apna meher zyada lene ka haqq hai aur is haqq se un ko koi mard rok nahi sakta."
