              "text": "Is liye sirf aise itar ka istemal kare jis mein spirit (alcohol) na ho. Alcohol wale scent ya itar ki pehchaan ye hai ke use agar hatheli par lagaya jaye to thandak mehsoos hogi aur fauran ud bhi jayega."
