              "type": "p",
              "text": "Auratein aise itar ka istemal karein jis ki khushboo halki ho. Aisi na ho ke jis ki khushboo ud kar mardon tak pahunch jaye. Aaj kal aksar auratein aise spray, itar ya phir powder, cream waghera ka istemal karti hain ke jis gali se guzar jayein saari gali mehak uthti hai aur man-chale ladke \"haaye haaye\" pukaarne lagte hain aur seetiyan baja baja kar be-hooda harkatein karte hain. Aisi auratein is hadees ko padh kar ibrat haasil karein."
