              "text": "**Mas'ala:** Mard apni biwi ke har uzw ko chhoo sakta hai aur aurat bhi apne shohar ke har uzw ko chhoo sakti hai khwah shehwat se ho ya bila shehwat. Yahan tak ke har ek doosre ki sharmgah ko dekh bhi sakte hain magar baghair zaroorat ke sharmgah ka dekhna aur chhoona khilaaf-e-aula wa makrooh hai. *(Fatawa Alamgiri, Jild 5, Safha 227; Bahar-e-Shariat, Jild 2, Hissa 16, Safha 57)*"
