              "text": "**Tarjuma:** *Allah Ta'ala Qiyamat ke din aise shakhs ki taraf nazar-e-rehmat nahi farmayega jis ne apni aurat ke peechhe ke muqaam mein sohbat ki hogi.* *(Bukhari Shareef, Muslim Shareef, Tirmizi Shareef, Nasa'i Shareef, Ibn Majah Shareef)*"
