              "text": "**(2)** Kapde dhone ki mitti (jise reh kehte hain) saath (60) gram lein, neem ki taaza pattiyon ka ras baarah (12) gram lein. In dono ko ek sau bees (120) millilitre paani mein bhigo kar raat bhar rakhein. Subah ko chhaan lein aur thoda sa neem ka ras mila kar subah ko pee lein."
