              "text": "Kuch auraton ko haiz aane se pehle koolhon aur raanon mein sakht dard hota hai. Kabhi kabhi matli aur qay (ulti) bhi hoti hai. Haiz ka khoon bahut hi kam miqdar mein aata hai aur dard ke saath aata hai."
