              "type": "p",
              "text": "Hazaaron mein ek do auratein paidaaishi baanjh hoti hain. Un ko shuru se hi haiz baraye-naam ek aadh dhabbe ke taur par aata hai aur un ka raham bhi bas baraye-naam hota hai. Koi bhi aurat ho agar use shuru hi se haiz ka khoon har maah apne muqarrara ayyam par baghair kisi takleef ke aata hai aur kam se kam teen din aur zyada se zyada das dinon tak jaari rehta hai, to aisi aurat ko baanjh nahi kaha ja sakta. Bachha na hone ki wajah aur koi doosri ho sakti hai. Aisi soorat mein mard mein bhi kami ke imkanaat ho sakte hain. Lihaza mard-o-aurat ko apna kisi achhe doctor se check-up karana chahiye."
