              "text": "Sahih Bukhari Shareef mein Abu amamh (RadiyAllahu Ta'ala Anhu) anhu se marwi hai, ke jab dastarkhwan athaya jaata, as waqt Nabi-e-Kareem (Sallallahu Ta'ala Alayhi wa Sallam)yh parhte: Alhamdulillah hmda ksira tyba mbarka fih ghir mkfi wala"
