              "text": "Tirmizi wa Abu dawdw Ibn Majah ne Abu Hurairah ((RadiyAllahu Ta'ala Anhu) anhu)se riwayat ki, ke Nabi-e-Kareem (Sallallahu Ta'ala Alayhi wa Sallam) ne farmaya: ’’jab kisi ke haath mein chkna'y ki bwa ho aur baghair haath dhoye swja'e aur is ko kuchh takleef puhanach jaaye to woh khud apne hi ko milamat kare. ‘‘ (2) assi ki misl Hazrat Fatimah zhrarzy allh Ta'ala 'naha se bhi marwi hai."
