              "text": "haakim ne Abu 'bs bun jabar (RadiyAllahu Ta'ala Anhu) anhu se riwayat ki, ke irshad farmaya: ’’khane ke waqt joote atar lo ke yeh Sunnat jmylh (achha Tareeqa) hai. ‘‘ (3) aur ans (RadiyAllahu Ta'ala Anhu) anhu ki riwayat mein hai, ke ’’khana rakha jaaye to joote atar lo, ke is se tumhare paaon ke liye raahat hai. ‘‘ (4)"
