              "id": "bs16_c01_h43",
              "label": "Hadees 43",
              "text": "Abu dawd Ayesha (RadiyAllahu Ta'ala Anhu) 'naha se raoi, ke Huzoor (Sallallahu Ta'ala Alayhi wa Aalihi wa Sallam) ne irshad farmaya ke (khaate waqt) gosht ko chhry se na katw ke yeh 'jmywn ka Tareeqa hai, is ko dant se nwch kar khao ke yeh khosh gwar aur zwd hzm hai. (5) yeh is waqt hai ke gosht achhi tarah pk gaya ho. haath ya dant se nwch kar khaaya ja sakta ho. aaj kal ywrp ki taqleed mein bahut se Musalman bhi chhry kante se khaate hain, yeh mzmwm Tareeqa hai aur agar ba-wajah-e-zaroorat chhry se gosht kat kar khaaya jaaye ke gosht itna gla hua nahin hai ke haath se twra jaske ya dantwn se nwcha jaske ya mislan mslm Raan bhuni hui hai ke dantwn se nwchne mein dqt hogi to chhry se kat kar khane mein haraj nahin, assi qism ke ba'z moaq' par Huzoor-e-Aqdas(Sallallahu Ta'ala Alayhi wa Sallam) ka chhry se gosht kat kar tanaol farmana aaya hai, is se aaj kal ke chhry kante se khane ki daleel lana Saheeh nahin."
