              "type": "masala",
              "id": "bs16_c05_m08",
              "label": "Mas'ala 6",
              "text": "Kaafir ya Faasiq ne yeh khabar di ke mein fulan Shakhs ka is cheez ke beechne mein wakeel hoon, is ki khabar a'tabar ki jasakati hai aur as cheez ko khrydskte hain. assi tarah deegar m'amlat mein bhi un ki khabarein maqbool hain, jabke zin ghalib yeh ho ke sach kehta hai. (6) (Durr-e-Mukhtar)"
