              "id": "bs16_c06_m19",
              "label": "Mas'ala 16",
              "text": "sone chandi se kapda bna jaaye jaisa ke bnarsy kapde mein zry Bani jaati hai. kam-khoab aur pwt mein zry hoti hai aur assi tarah bnarsy imama ke kinare aur donon taraf ke hashye zry ke hote hain un ka yeh Hukm hai ke agar ek jagah chaar anagal se ziyada ho to Najaiz hai, warnah Jaiz, magar kam-khoab aur pwt mein choonke tana bana (4) donon resham hota hai, lihaza zry agarche chaar anagal se kam ho, jab bhi Najaiz hai. haan agar sooti kapda hota ya tana resham aur bana swt hota aur as mein zry Bani jaati to chaar anagal tak Jaiz hota. jaisa ke imama swt ka hota hai aur is mein zry Bani jaati hai, is ka yehi Hukm hai ke ek jagah chaar anagal se ziyada Najaiz hai, yeh Hukm mardon ke liye hai. auraton ke liye resham aur sona chandi pehanna Jaiz hai, un ke liye chaar anagal ki takhasis nahin. assi tarah auraton ke liye"
