              "text": "kmr ki pyty resham ki ho to Najaiz hai aur agar sooti ho, is mein resham ki dhary ho aur chaar anagal tak ho to Jaiz hai. (6) (Alamgiri) klabtw (7) ki pyty Najaiz hai. ba'z rosa apne sapahion aur chprasywn ki pitiyan is qism ki bnwate hain, in ko buchana chahiye."
