              "text": "resham ki topi agarche imama ke neeche ho, yeh bhi Najaiz hai. assi tarah zry ki topi bhi naja'zhe, agarche imama ke neeche ho. (9) (Durr-e-Mukhtar, Radd-ul-Muhtar) zirein kilah jo afghany aur srhdy aur pnjaby imama ke neeche phnte hain aur woh mghrq hoti hai aur is ka kaam chaar anagal se ziyada hota hai yeh Najaiz hai, haan agrchar anagal ya kam ho to Jaiz hai."
