              "id": "bs16_c09_h10",
              "label": "Hadees 8",
              "text": "Abu dawd wa Nasa'i ne Hazrat Ali (RadiyAllahu Ta'ala Anhu) anhu se riwayat ki, ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Ta'ala Alayhi wa Sallam) ne dahne haath mein resham liya aur baayein haath mein sona phir yeh farmaya ke ’’yeh donon cheezein meri amat ke mardon par Haram hain ‘‘ (2)"
