              "id": "bs16_c09_h14",
              "label": "Hadees 12",
              "text": "Imam maalik (Rahmatullah Alayh) mwta mein farmate hain, ke bachchon ko sona phnana bura jaanta hoon, kyunke mujhe yeh hadees pahunchi hai, ke ’’Rasoolullah(Sallallahu Ta'ala Alayhi wa Sallam) ne sone ki angoothi se miman't farmai. ‘‘ (6) lihaza mardon ke liye bura hai, chhotay aur baday donon ke liye."
