              "id": "bs16_c09_m03",
              "label": "Mas'ala 2",
              "text": "angoothi Sarf chandi hi ki phny jasakati hai, doosri dhat ki angoothi pehanna Haram hai, mislan loha, peetal, tamba, jst waghairaha in dhatwn ki angoothian Mard wa Aurat donon ke liye Najaiz hain. faraq itna hai ke Aurat sona bhi pahan rakhe sakati hai aur Mard nahin pahan rakhe sakta. hadees mein hai ke ek Shakhs Huzoor (Sallallahu Ta'ala Alayhi wa Aalihi wa Sallam) ki khidmat mein peetal ki angoothi pahan rakhe kar hazar hue, farmaya: kiya baat hai ke tum se b(T) ki bwa aati hai? unhon ne woh angoothi phynk di phir doosre din lohe ki angoothi pahan rakhe kar hazar hue, farmaya: kiya baat hai ke tum par Jahannamiyon ka zewar dekhta hoon? unhon ne is ko bhi atar diya aur arz ki, yaRasoolullah! (Sallallahu Ta'ala Alayhi wa Aalihi wa Sallam)kis cheez ki angoothi banaon? farmaya ke ’’chandi ki aur is ko ek misaqal poora na karna. ‘‘ (4) (Durr-e-Mukhtar, Radd-ul-Muhtar)"
