              "text": "jis Aurat se Nikah karna chahta hai agar is ko dekhna na-mimakan ho jaisa ke is zamana ka riwaaj yeh hai ke agar kisi ne Nikah ka Paigham de diya to kisi tarah bhi use Ladki ko nahin dekhne dein ge ya'ni is se itna zbrdst Pardah kiya jaata hai ke doosre se itna Pardah nahin hota is soorat mein is Shakhs ko yeh chahiye ke kisi Aurat ko bhij kar dkhwale aur woh aakar is ke saamne sara hlyh wa nqshh waghairah bayan kar de taake use is ki shakal wswrt ke muta'alliq atmyna n ho jaaye. (3) (Radd-ul-Muhtar)"
