              "text": "jis Aurat se Nikah karna chahta hai, is ki ek Ladki bhi hai aur ma'loom hua ke yeh Ladki bilkul apni maan ki shakal wa soorat ki hai is mqsd se ke is ki maan se Nikah karna hai Ladki ko dekhna Jaiz nahin jabke yeh mshthaۃ ho. (4) (Radd-ul-Muhtar)"
