              "text": "ajnabiyyah Aurat ki taraf nazar karne mein zaroorat ki ek soorat yeh bhi hai ke Aurat beemar hai is ke Ilaaj mein ba'z a'za ki taraf nazar karne ki zaroorat padti hai balke is ke jism ko chhoona padta hai. mislan nabaz dekhne mein haath chhoona hota hai ya pit mein wrm ka khayaal ho to ttwl kar dekhna hota hai ya kisi jagah phwra ho to use dekhna hota hai balke ba'z martaba ttwlna bhi padta hai is soorat mein moz' maraz ki taraf nazar karna ya is zaroorat se buqadar zaroorat is jagah ko chhoona Jaiz hai. yeh is soorat mein hai koi Aurat Ilaaj karne wali na ho, warnah chahiye yeh ke auraton ko bhi Ilaaj karna sakhaia jaaye taake aise moaq' par woh kaam karein ke un ke dekhne waghairah mein itni kharabi nahin jo Mard ke dekhne waghairah mein hai. aksar jagah da'yan hoti hain jo pit ke wrm ko dikh sakati hain jahan da'yan disatiab hoon Mard ko dekhne ki zaroorat baqi nahin rahti. Ilaaj ki zaroorat se nazar karne mein bhi yeh ehtiyat zaroori hai ke Sarf itna hi hissa badan khwla jaaye jis ke dekhne ki zaroorat hai baqi hissa badan ko achhi tarah chhipa diya jaaye ke is par nazar na pade. (5) (Hidayah waghairaha)"
