              "text": "Aurat ko Daadhi ya moonchh ke Baal nikal aayein to un ka nochna Jaiz balke Mustahab hai ke kahein is ke Shauhar ko is se nafrat na paida ho. (2) (Radd-ul-Muhtar)"
