              "text": "Tirmizi wa Abu dawd ne kldh bun hanabal se riwayat ki, kehte hain ke sfwan bun amyh ne mujhe Nabi-e-Kareem (Sallallahu Ta'ala Alayhi wa Sallam) ke paas bheja tha mein baghair salam kiye aur baghair ijazat andar chala gaya. Huzoor (Sallallahu Ta'ala Alayhi wa Aalihi wa Sallam) ne farmaya: ’’baahar jao aur yeh kaho alslam 'likm ' adkhlkiya andar aajon. (4)"
