              "label": "Hadees 5",
              "text": "Imam maalik ne 'ta bun ysar((RadiyAllahu Ta'ala Anhu) anhu) se riwayat ki, kehte hain ke ek Shakhs ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Ta'ala Alayhi wa Sallam) se daryaaft kiya ke kiya mein apni maan ke paas jaon to is se bhi ijazat lon. Huzoor (Sallallahu Ta'ala Alayhi wa Aalihi wa Sallam) ne farmaya: haan. unhon ne kaha mein to is ke saath assi Makaan mein rahta hi hoon. Huzoor (Sallallahu Ta'ala Alayhi wa Aalihi wa Sallam)ne farmaya: ijazat le kar is ke paas jao, unhon ne kaha, mein is ki khidmat karta hoon ya'ni baar baar aana jaana hota hai. phir ijazat ki kiya zaroorat hai? Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Ta'ala Alayhi wa Sallam) ne farmaya ke ’’ijazat le kar jao, kiya tum yeh pusanad karte ho ke use burahanah dykhw? arz ki nahin, farmaya:to ijazat haasil karo. ‘‘ (5)"
