              "text": "aane wale ne salam nahin kiya aur baat chit shuru kar di to use ikhtiyar hai, ke uski baat ka Jawab na de ke RasoolullahSallallahu Allah Ta'ala alayh wslm ne farmaya ke ’’ jis ne salam se qabl Kalam kiya, is ki baat ka Jawab na do. ‘‘ (6) (Radd-ul-Muhtar)"
