              "type": "hadith",
              "id": "bs16_c14_h01",
              "label": "Hadees 1",
              "text": "Sahih Bukhari wa Muslim mein Abu Hurairah (RadiyAllahu Ta'ala Anhu) anhu se marwi, ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Ta'ala Alayhi wa Sallam) ne farmaya ke Allah Ta'alane adm (Alayhis Salam) ko un ki soorat par paida farmaya, un ka qad saath haath ka tha, jab paida kiya yeh farmaya ke in frshtwn ke paas jao aur salam karo aur snw ke woh tumhein kiya Jawab dete hain jo kuchh woh tahiyyat karein wohi tumhari aur tumhari zryt ki tahiyyat hai. Hazrat adm (Alayhis Salam) ne in ke paas ja kar Assalamu Alaykum kaha, unhon ne Jawab mein kaha: alsla-m 'lik warhmۃ Allah. Huzoor (Sallallahu Ta'ala Alayhi wa Aalihi wa Sallam) ne farmaya ke Jawab mein mla'kh ne warhmۃ allhzyadh kiya. Huzoor (Sallallahu Ta'ala Alayhi wa Aalihi wa Sallam) ne farmaya: jo Shakhs Jannat mein jaaye ga woh adm (Alayhis Salam) ki soorat par hoga aur saath haath lamba hoga. adm (Alayhis Salam) ke ba'd logon ki khlqt kam hoti gayi yahan tak ke ab. (2) (bahut chhotay qad ka anasan hota hai)."
