              "text": "Imam Ahmad wa Tirmizi wa Ibn Majah ne bra' bun 'azb (RadiyAllahu Ta'ala Anhu) anhu se riwayat ki, ke Nabi-e-Kareem (Sallallahu Ta'ala Alayhi wa Sallam) ne farmaya: ’’jab do Musalman mil kar musafaha karte hain to jada hone se pehle hi un ki maghfirat hojati hai. ‘‘ (5) aur Abu dawd ki riwayat mein hai, ’’jab do Musalman milein aur musafaha karein aur Allah (Azza wa Jall) ki hamd karein aur Istighfaar karein to donon ki maghfirat ho jaaye gi. ‘‘ (6)"
