              "label": "Mas'ala 1",
              "text": "chheenk ka Jawab dena Wajib hai, jabke chheenkne wala Alhamdulillah kahe aur is ka Jawab bhi fora dena aur is tarah Jawab dena ke woh san le, Wajib hai. jis tarah salam ke Jawab mein hai yahan bhi hai. (8) (Durr-e-Mukhtar, Radd-ul-Muhtar)"
