              "id": "bs16_c16_m05",
              "label": "Mas'ala 5",
              "text": "Aurat ko chheenk aayi agar woh boodhi hai to Mard is ka Jawab de, agar jawan hai to is tarah Jawab de ke woh na sune. Mard ko chheenk aayi aur Aurat ne Jawab diya, agar jawan hai to Mard is ka Jawab apne dil mein de aur boodhi hai to zor se Jawab de sakta hai. (6) (Alamgiri)"
