              "text": "chheenkne wale ko chahiye ke zor se hamd kahe taake koi sune aur Jawab de. chheenk ka Jawab ba'z hazarin ne dydya to sab ki taraf se ho gaya aur behtar yeh hai ke sab hazarin Jawab dein. (9) (Radd-ul-Muhtar)"
