              "label": "Hadees 1",
              "text": "Sahih Bukhari mein Hazrat Usman Ghani (RadiyAllahu Ta'ala Anhu) anhu se marwi, ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Ta'ala Alayhi wa Sallam) ne farmaya: ’’tum mein behtar woh Shakhs hai, jo Quran sykhe aur skha'e. ‘‘ (1)"
