              "text": "Sahih Bukhari wa Muslim mein Abu mwsy ash'ry (RadiyAllahu Ta'ala Anhu) anhu se marwi, ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Ta'ala Alayhi wa Sallam) ne farmaya: ’’jo Momin Quran parhta hai, is ki msal trnj ki si hai ke Khushboo bhi achhi hai awrmzh bhi achha hai aur jo Momin Quran nahin parhta, woh khajoor ki misl hai ke is mein Khushboo nahin magar mizah sherein hai. aur jo Munafiq Quran nahin parhta, woh andra'n ki misl hai ke is mein Khushboo bhi nahin hai aur mizah kadwa hai aur jo Munafiq Quran parhta hai, woh phool ki misl hai ke is mein Khushboo hai magar mizah kadwa. ‘‘(3)"
