              "text": "Sahih Muslim mein Hazrat Umar (RadiyAllahu Ta'ala Anhu) anhu se marwi, ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Ta'ala Alayhi wa Sallam) ne farmaya ke ’’Allah Ta'ala is Kitaab se bahut logon ko buland karta hai aur bahuton ko psat karta hai. ‘‘ (4) ya'ni jo is par Imaan late aur amal karte hain, an ke liye bulanadi hai aur dosaron ke liye psty hai."
