              "id": "bs16_c18_h18",
              "label": "Hadees 18",
              "text": "Imam Ahmad wa Abu dawd wa Ibn Majah wdarmy ne bra' bun 'azb (RadiyAllahu Ta'ala Anhu) anhu se riwayat ki, ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Ta'ala Alayhi wa Sallam) ne farmaya: ’’Quran ko apni aaoazon se mzyn karo. ‘‘ (1) aur darmy ki riwayat mein hai ke ’’apni aaoazon se Quran ko khwbswrt karo, kyunke achhi aoaz Quran ka Hasan burha deti hai. ‘‘ (2)"
