              "text": "*[1] ’’al-Fatawa al-Hindiyyah‘‘, Kitaab al-Karahiyah, albab alsamn Ushr fi altdawy, j5, s355.* | *[2] almrj' alsabq.* | *[3] wrm ki jama, swjn.* | *[4] ya'ni ghla hua ata jo ag par puka kar garha kiya gaya ho.* | *[5] ’’al-Fatawa al-Hindiyyah‘‘, Kitaab al-Karahiyah, albab alsamn Ushr fi altdawy, j5, s356.* | *[6] ’’al-Hidayah‘‘, Kitaab al-Karahiyah, masail mtfrqh, j2, s381.* | *[8] ’’tbyyn alhqa'q‘‘, Kitaab al-Karahiyah, fasal fi alnzr wallms, j9, s40.* | *[9] ’’Radd-ul-Muhtar‘‘, Kitaab alhzr walإbahۃ, fasal fi alby', j9, s708, 709.*"
