              "id": "bs16_c22_m01",
              "label": "Mas'ala 1",
              "text": "nwbt bujana agar tfakhr ke liye ho to Najaiz hai aur agar logon ko is se mtnbh karna miqasod ho aur nfkhat swr yaddlane ke liye ho to teen waqton mein nwbt bujane ki ijazat hai ba'd Asr aur ba'd 'sha aur ba'd nisf shab ke in auqaat mein nwbt ko nfkh swr se mishabahat hai. (3) (Durr-e-Mukhtar) yeh niyyat bahut achhi hai agar nwbt bjwane wale ko bhi is ka dhyan ho aur kash sunne wale ko bhi nwbt ki aawaz san kar nfkhat swr yaad aayein, magar is zamana mein aise log kahan, yahan to nwbt se miqasod dhwm dham aur Shaadi byaah ki rwnq wa zeenat hai."
