              "text": "*[1] ’’Saheeh al-Bukhari‘‘, Kitaab aladib, bab alإnbsat ali alanas, al-Hadees:6130, j4, s134.* | *wa’’Sahih Muslim‘‘, Kitaab fza'l alasahabat, bab fi fza'l 'a'shۃ... ilakh, al-Hadees:81. (2440), s1325.* | *[2] ’’sunan Abi dawd‘‘, Kitaab aladib, bab all'b ba lbnat, al-Hadees:4932, j4, s369.* | *[3] ’’ad-Durr al-Mukhtar‘‘, Kitaab alhzr walإbahۃ, j9, s578.* | *[4] ’’Radd-ul-Muhtar‘‘, Kitaab alhzr walإbahۃ, j9, s579.* | *wa’’al-Fatawa al-Hindiyyah‘‘, Kitaab al-Karahiyah, albab alsab' Ushr fi alghna', j5, s352.*"
