              "id": "bs16_c25_h02",
              "label": "Hadees 2",
              "text": "Sahih Bukhari mein Abu Hurairah (RadiyAllahu Ta'ala Anhu) anhu se marwi, ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Ta'ala Alayhi wa Sallam) ne farmaya ke ’’bunadah Allah Ta'alaki khoshanodi ki baat bolta hai aur is ki taraf twjh bhi nahin karta ya'ni yeh khayaal bhi nahin karta ke Allah Ta'ala itna khosh hoga, Allah Ta'ala is ko dirajon buland karta hai aur bunadah Allah Ta'ala ki na-khushi ki baat bolta hai aur is ki taraf dhyan nahin dhrta ya'ni is ke zihan mein yeh baat nahin hoti ke Allah Ta'ala is se itna naraz hoga, is kilamah ki wajah se Jahannam mein girta hai. ‘‘ (5) aur Bukhari wa Muslim ki ek riwayat mein hai ke ’’Jahannam ki itni ghra'y mein girta hai jo misharaq wa Maghrib ke fasalah se bhi ziyada hai. ‘‘ (6)"
