              "text": "Imam Ahmad wtrmzy ne 'qbh bun 'amr (RadiyAllahu Ta'ala Anhu) anhu se riwayat ki, kehte hain mein Huzoor (Sallallahu Ta'ala Alayhi wa Sallam) ki khidmat mein hazar hua aur arz ki, njat kiya hai? irshad farmaya: ’’apni zaban par qabw rakho aur tumhara ghar tumhare liye gunajaish rakhe (ya'ni be kar idhar udhar na jao) aur apni khatan par gurih karo. ‘‘ (3)"
