              "id": "bs16_c31_h05",
              "label": "Hadees 5",
              "text": "sharah snh mein Ibn Abbas (RadiyAllahu Ta'ala Anhu) 'nhma se riwayat hai, ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Ta'ala Alayhi wa Sallam) ne farmaya: ’’jo Shakhs yateem ko apne khane peene mein sharik kare, allh Ta'ala is ke liye zaroor Jannat Wajib kar de ga magar jabke aisa gunah kiya ho jis ki maghfirat na ho aur jo Shakhs teen ladkiyon ya itni hi behanon ki parwarish kare, in ko adab skha'e, in par meherbani kare yahan tak ke allh Ta'ala unhein be niyaz kar de (ya'ni ab in ko zaroorat baqi na rahe), Allah Ta'ala is ke liye Jannat Wajib kar de ga. ‘‘ kisi ne kaha, iarasol allh! (Sallallahu Ta'ala Alayhi wa Aalihi wa Sallam) ya do (ya'ni do ki parwarish mein yehi sawab ho jaaye), farmaya: do (ya'ni in mein bhi wohi sawab hai) aur agar logon ne ek ke muta'alliq kaha hota to Huzoor (Sallallahu Ta'ala Alayhi wa Aalihi wa Sallam) ek ko bhi farma dete. aur jis ki krim(T)in kwallh(Azza wa Jall)ne door kar diya, is ke liye Jannat Wajib hai. daryaaft kiya gaya krim(T)in kiya hain? farmaya: aanakhein. (3)"
