              "label": "Hadees 17",
              "text": "Bayhaqi ne 'bad Allah bun 'mrwa (RadiyAllahu Ta'ala Anhu) 'nhma se busanad z'if riwayat ki, ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Ta'ala Alayhi wa Sallam) ne farmaya: tumhein ma'loom hai ke prwsy ka kiya haqq hai? yeh ke jab woh tum se midad mange midad karo aur jab Qarz mange Qarz do aur jab mihataj ho to use do aur jab beemar ho iyaadat karo aur jab use khair pahunche to Mubarak bad do aur jab msybt pahunche to Ta'ziyat karo aur mirajaie to Janazah ke saath jao aur baghair ijazat apni 'marat buland na karo, ke is ki hua rok do aur apni handy se is ko aiza na do, magar is mein se kuchh use bhi do aur mywe khrydw to is ke paas bhi hadih karo aur agar hadih na karna ho to chhipa kar Makaan mein lao aur tumhare bachchay use le kar baahar na nikalein ke prwsy ke bachchon ko ranj hoga. tumhein ma'loom hai ke prwsy ka kiya haqq hai? qism hai is ki jis ke haath mein meri jan hai! poori taur par prwsy ka haqq ada karne wale thode hain, wohi hain jin par Allah (Azza wa Jall) ki meherbani hai. baraabar prwsy ke muta'alliq Huzoor (Sallallahu Ta'ala Alayhi wa Aalihi wa Sallam) Wasiyat farmate rahe yahan tak ke logon ne gumaan kiya ke prwsy ko Waaris kiradin ge. phir Huzoor (Sallallahu Ta'ala Alayhi wa Aalihi wa Sallam) ne farmaya ke ’’prwsy teen qism ke hain, ba'z ke teen haqq hain, ba'z ke do aur ba'z ka ek haqq hai. jo prwsy Muslim ho aur rishta wala ho, is ke teen haqq hain. haqq jwar aur haqq Islam aur haqq qarabat. prwsy Muslim ke do haqq hain, haqq jwar aur haqq Islam aur prwsy Kaafir ka Sarf ek haqq jwar hai. ‘‘ hum ne arz ki, yaRasoolullah! (Sallallahu Ta'ala Alayhi wa Aalihi wa Sallam) in ko apni Qurbanion mein se dein? farmaya ke Mushrikeen ko Qurbanion mein se kuchh na do. (4)"
