              "text": "chhat par chrhne mein dosaron ke gharon mein nigah pahunchti hai to woh log chhat par chrhne se mana kirasakate hain, jab tak Pardah ki deewar na bnwale ya koi aisi cheez na lgale jis se be puradagi na ho aur agar doosre logon ke gharon mein nazar nahin padti magar woh log jab chhat par chrhte hain to samna hota hai to is ko chrhne se mana nahin kirasakate, balke un ki misatorat ko yeh chahiye ke woh khud chhaton par na chrhyn taake be puradagi na ho. (1) (Durr-e-Mukhtar)"
