              "text": "’’ya'ni Rasool jo kuchh tumhein dein use lo aur jis cheez se mana kar dein is se baaz ajao. ‘‘ is Aurat ne kaha, haan yeh parha hai. Abdullah bin Mas'ood ne farmaya ke Huzoor (Sallallahu Ta'ala Alayhi wa Aalihi wa Sallam) ne is se mana farma ya hai. ek riwayat mein hai ke is ke ba'd is Aurat ne yeh kaha ke in mein ki ba'z baatein to aap ki Bi Bi mein bhi hain. 'bdallhbn mis'od ne farmaya andar ja kar dykhw woh Makaan mein gayi phir a'y, to aap ne farmaya kiya dekha? is ne kaha kuchh nahin dekha. Abdullah ne farmaya agar is mein yeh baat hoti to mere saath nahin rahti. ya'ni aisi Aurat mere ghar mein nahin rah sakati hai. (6)"
