              "type": "hadith",
              "id": "bs16_c38_h25",
              "label": "Hadees 25",
              "text": "Sahih Bukhari mein Abu Hurairah (RadiyAllahu Ta'ala Anhu) anhu se marwi, ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Ta'ala Alayhi wa Sallam) ne farmaya ke"
