              "label": "Mas'ala 8",
              "text": "yeh Shakhs sawari par hai aur is ke saath aur log pydl chl rahe hain agar mahz apni shan dkhane aur takabbur ke liye aisa karta hai to mana hai. (7) (Alamgiri) aur zaroorat se ho to haraj nahin mislan yeh boodha ya kmzwr hai ke chl na sake ga ya saath wale kisi tarah uske pydl chalne ko gwara hi nahin karte, jaisa ke ba'z martaba 'lama wa mshaykh ke saath doosre log khud pydl chalte hain aur in ko pydl chalne nahin dete, is mein kirahat nahin jabke apne dil ko qabw mein rakhein aur takabbur na aane dein aur mahz in logon ki dljw'y minazor ho. Mas'ala9: Mard ko Daadhi aur sar waghairah ke Baalon mein Khizaab lagana Jaiz balke Mustahab hai magar siyah Khizaab lagana mana hai ha n mjahd ko siyah Khizaab bhi Jaiz hai ke dushman ki nazar mein is ki wajah se hybt baithe gi. (8) (Durr-e-Mukhtar) naam rakhne ka bayan Allah(Azza wa Jall)farmata hai: { iaiهa alzin amnwaa la iskhr qwam mn qwam 'sى an iكwanwaa khira mnهm wa la nsa' mn nsa' 'sى an iكn"
