              "text": "*[1] ya'ni faraiz ko na chhore.* | *[2] ziyarat ke muta'alliq masail hissa chaharam mein zikr kiye gaye hain. wahan se ma'loom karein. 12 munh* | *[3] ’’Sahih Muslim‘‘, Kitaab aljna'z, bab ast'zan alnby Sallallahu allh alayh wa Sallam rbh(Azza wa Jall)... ilakh, al-Hadees:106. (977), s486.* | *[4] ’’Sunan Ibn Majah‘‘, Kitaab maja' fi aljna'z, bab ma ja' fi zyarۃ alqbwr, al-Hadees:1571, j2, s252.* | *[5] ’’Sahih Muslim‘‘, Kitaab aljna'z, bab ma yqal inda dkhwl alqbwr... ilakh, al-Hadees:104. (975), s485.* | *wa’’Sunan Ibn Majah‘‘, Kitaab maja' fi aljna'z, bab maja' fyma yqal إza dikhal almqabr, al-Hadees:1547, j2, s240.* | *tarajamah:ae qabristan wale mwmnw awrmslmanw! tum par slamty ho aur InshaAllah(Azza wa Jall)hum tum se amilein ge, hum Allah(Azza wa Jall)se apne liye aur tmharelye 'afyt ka Sawaal karte hain.*"
