              "type": "hadith",
              "id": "bs16_c45_h05",
              "label": "Hadees 5",
              "text": "Sahih Muslim mein Hazrat Ayesha (RadiyAllahu Ta'ala Anhu) 'naha se marwi, kehti hain ke jab meri bary ki raat hoti Huzoor (Sallallahu Ta'ala Alayhi wa Aalihi wa Sallam) aakhar shab mein bqy' ko jaate aur yeh farmate:alslam 'likm dar qwam mwamnin waa (T)akm ma (T)wa'dwan ghda mwajlwan waana an sha' allh bkm lahqwan allhm aghfr la hl bqi' alghrqd. (2)"
