              "text": "Bayhaqi ne Shu'ab al-Iman mein Muhammad bun n'man se mrsla riwayat ki, ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Ta'ala Alayhi wa Sallam) ne farmaya: ’’jo apne waalidain ki donon ya ek ki har Jumu'ah mein ziyarat kare ga, is ki maghfirat ho jaaye gi aur nykw kar likha jaaye ga. ‘‘ (3)"
