              "id": "bs16_c45_h07",
              "label": "Hadees 7",
              "text": "khatib ne Abu Hurairah (RadiyAllahu Ta'ala Anhu) anhu se riwayat ki, ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Ta'ala Alayhi wa Sallam) ne farmaya: ’’jab koi Shakhs aise ki Qabr par guzare jise dunya mein phchanta tha aur is par salam kare to woh mrdh use phchanta hai aur is ke salam ka Jawab deta hai. ‘‘ (4)"
