              "type": "masala",
              "id": "bs16_c45_m04",
              "label": "Mas'ala 5",
              "text": "qabristan ke darakht ka Hukm yeh hai ke agar woh darakht qabristan se pehle ka hai ya'ni Zameen ko jab qabristan bunaia gaya is waqt woh darakht wahan maujood tha, to jis ki Zameen hai assi ka darakht hai woh jo chahe kare aur agar woh Zameen bnjr thi kisi ki mlk na thi to darakht aur Zameen ka woh hissa jis mein darakht hai assi pehli haalat par hai ke kisi ki mlk nahin aur agar qabristan hone ke ba'd ka"
