              "type": "p",
              "text": "*[1] ’’Sahih Muslim‘‘, Kitaab aljna'z, bab إst'zan alnbysly allh alayh wa Sallam rbh(Azza wa Jall)... ilakh, al-Hadees:106. (977), s486.* | *[2] ’’al-Fatawa al-Hindiyyah‘‘, Kitaab al-Karahiyah, albab alsads Ushr fi zyarۃ alqbwr, j5, s350.* | *[3] almrj' alsabq.* | *[4] pair.* | *[5] jam'rat.* | *[6] ’’al-Fatawa al-Hindiyyah‘‘, Kitaab al-Karahiyah, albab alsads Ushr fi zyarۃ alqbwr, j5, s350.*"
