              "text": "Rajab ki 26 wa 27 ko roze rakhte hain, pehle ko hzary aur doosre ko likhi kehte hain ya'ni pehle mein hazaar roze ka sawab aur doosre mein ek lakh ka sawab butate hain. in rozon ke rakhne mein muzayaqah nahin, magar yeh jo sawab ke muta'alliq mishahor hai is ka saboot nahin."
