              "id": "bs16_c46_m10",
              "label": "Mas'ala 7",
              "text": "ashrah mahram mein majlis mn'qd karna aur waq'at kirabala bayan karna Jaiz hai jabke riwayaat sahihah bayan ki jaayein, in waq'at mein sbrw thml Raza wa tasalim ka bahut mikamal dars hai aur pabanadi ahkaam shariat wa Ittiba-e-Sunnat ka zbrdst 'mly saboot hai ke deen haqq ki hafazat mein tamam a'zh wa aqrba wa rfqa aur khud apne ko rah Khuda mein qrban kiya aur jz' wa fz' ka naam bhi na aane diya, magar is majlis mein Sahabah kiram (RadiyAllahu Ta'ala Anhu) 'naham ka bhi zikr khair hojana chahiye taake Ahl-e-Sunnat aur shy'wn ki mijalas mein faraq wa amtyazr hai."
