              "text": "t'zih dari ke waq'at kirabala ke salasalah mein tarah tarah ke dhanche bunate aur in ko Hazrat Sayyiduna Imam hasin (RadiyAllahu Ta'ala Anhu) anhu ke rozah Paak ki shbyh kehte hain, kahein takhat bunaie jaate hain, kahein zryh bnty hai (1) aur Ilm aur shde (2) nakale jaate hain, dhol tashe aur qism qism ke baje bujaie jaate hain, t'zywn ka bahut dhwm dham se gsht hota hai, aage peeche hone mein jahlyt ke se jhgre hote hain, kabhi darakht ki shakhyn katy jatyn hain, kahein chbwtre khwdwa'e jaate hain, t'zywn se mannatein maani jaati hain, sone chandi ke 'lm chrha'e jaate hain, haar phool naryl chrhate hain, wahan joote pahan rakhe kar jaane ko gunah jaante hain balke is shadat se mana karte hain ke gunah par bhi aisi miman't nahin karte chhtry lagane ko bahut bura jaante hain. t'zywn ke andar do msnw'y qabrein bunate hain, ek par sabz ghlaf aur doosri par surkh ghlaf dalte hain, sabz ghlaf wali ko Hazrat Sayyiduna Imam Hasan (RadiyAllahu Ta'ala Anhu) anhu ki Qabr aur surkh ghlaf wali ko Hazrat Sayyiduna Imam hasin (RadiyAllahu Ta'ala Anhu) anhu ki Qabr ya shbyh Qabr butate hain aur wahan shrbt malydh waghairah par Fatihah dlwate hain. yeh tswr karke ke Hazrat Imam 'ali muqaam ke rozah aur mwajhh aqadas mein Fatihah dlarhe hain phir yeh t'zye disoin tarikh ko msnw'y kirabala mein le ja kar dafn karte hain goya yeh Janazah tha jise dafn kar aaye phir tyjh disoan chalyswan sab kuchh kiya jaata hai aur har ek khrafat par mishatamal hota hai. Hazrat qasam (RadiyAllahu Ta'ala Anhu) anhu ki mnhdy nakalte hain goya un ki Shaadi horahi hai aur mnhdy rcha'y jaaye gi aur assi t'zih dari ke salasalah mein koi pyk (3) bnta hai jis ke kmrse ghngrw bndhe hote hain goya yeh Hazrat Imam 'ali muqaam ka qasd aur har karh hai jo yahan se khat le kar Ibn zyad ya izid ke paas jaaye ga aur woh har karon ki tarah bhaaga phrta hai. kisi Bachah ko Faqeer bunaia jaata hai aws ke gule mein jhwly dalte aur ghar ghar is se bhyk mngwate hain, koi sqh (4) bunaia jaata"
